From: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] mtd: rawnand: mtk: add Airoha EN7581 support

EN7581 shares the NFI register bank between serial and parallel NAND. Add
the EN7581 register layout, polling completion, byte counters, and controller
initialization required by the parallel data path.

Signed-off-by: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>

